# Journal App

A simple Journal Application built with **Spring Boot** and **MySQL**, allowing users to create, view, update, and delete journal entries. The app provides an easy-to-use interface to manage personal notes and reflections.

## Features
- Add new journal entries with a title, content, and date.
- View all journal entries in a list.
- Update or delete existing entries.
- Search entries by title or date (if implemented).
- Simple and user-friendly interface with Thymeleaf templates.

## Tech Stack
- **Backend:** Java, Spring Boot
- **Frontend:** Thymeleaf
- **Database:** MySQL
- **Build Tool:** Maven

